# REVIEWED: 5478e139cbcf9958
#: ../../generator.rst:3
msgid "Widget Generator"
msgstr "Generador de widgets"

# REVIEWED: 28e6ec3784d8a495
#: ../../generator.rst:5
msgid ""
"The `d-portal Generator "
"<https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?#view=generator>`_ is a tool "
"to help users to reproduce IATI data in their own webpages or blogs. It "
"generates HTML code which you can copy into your webpage to create an IATI "
"widget."
msgstr ""
"El `Generador de d-portal "
"<https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?#view=generator>`_ es una "
"herramienta para ayudar a los usuarios a reproducir los datos de IATI en sus"
" propias páginas web o blogs. Genera código HTML que puede copiar en su "
"página web para crear un widget de IATI."

# REVIEWED: 7f30868080cc809f
#: ../../generator.rst:8
msgid ""
"These widgets can show IATI data in table, graph, map, or list formats:"
msgstr ""
"Estos widgets pueden mostrar datos de IATI en formato de tabla, gráfico, "
"mapa o lista:"

# REVIEWED: 54aaf21f00795a00
#: ../../generator.rst:10
msgid "Published by specific :iati-reference:`reporting-org`"
msgstr "Publicado por :iati-reference:`reporting-org` específico"

# REVIEWED: b2d15b85c4c57457
#: ../../generator.rst:11
msgid "Describing funds a specific :iati-reference:`recipient-country`."
msgstr ""
"Describen los fondos de un :iati-reference:`recipient-country` específico."

# REVIEWED: 29a7787a91b9e415
#: ../../generator.rst:13
msgid ""
"The resulting widget will update automatically overnight, in line with "
"d-portal."
msgstr ""
"El widget de IATI resultante se actualizará automáticamente durante la "
"noche, en concordancia con d-portal."

# REVIEWED: 03326d02d5e456d5
#: ../../generator.rst:15
msgid ""
"Both secured and non-secured HTTP access is supported by d-portal. This "
"means users on secured domains should also be able to use d-portal Generator"
" content."
msgstr ""
"d-portal admite tanto el acceso HTTP seguro como el no seguro. Esto "
"significa que los usuarios de dominios seguros también deberían poder "
"utilizar los contenidos del Generador de d-portal."
